SUMMARY:Pilot Knob from Pisgah Inn - 10 Miles\, 3K Ft Gain
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**Details**\n\n* 10 Miles\, 3000 F
 t elevation gain\n* Carpool meeting time is 9:20 at the Asheville Outlets 
 parking lot behind the Waffle House.\n* Sign up starts Friday at 5pm\n\nTh
 is hike is based on one of my favorite Mark Montgomery hikes but his route
  is not available due to the continued closure of Yellow Gap Rd. This is t
 he shortest route I could make to Pilot Knob where we will stop for a lunc
 h break and see if the rattlesnakes are still there. It will be one of my 
 tougher hikes but we will take breaks as needed. The major uphill portion 
 will be towards the end of the hike. Please do not sign up unless you are 
 confident you can do the mileage and elevation gain.\n\nhttps://www.alltra
 ils.com/explore/custom-routes/pisgah-inn-to-pilot-cove-loop-b40ffcb\n\nThe
 re is an opportunity after the hike to sit out on the rocking chairs behin
 d the inn and enjoy a snack/drink from the shop.\n\n**CARPOOL**\nWe will m
 eet at the Asheville Outlets behind the Waffle House at 9:20. Please be th
 ere ontime so we can leave at 9:30 for the trailhead. Please let me know i
 f you plan to meet us at the Pisgah Inn parking lot and be there by 10:00.
 \n\n**WEATHER**\nI'll watch the weather and post a cancellation message by
  7:30 AM if the forecast is >50% chance of precipitation.\n\n**QUESTIONS?*
 *\nYou can message me through MeetUp until 9:00 AM the day of. Cell recept
 ion may be sketchy\, but you can try to text or call me up to the start of
  the hike: (508) 965-2333.\n\n**LEGALESE**\nThis Asheville Hiking Group ev
 ent involves hiking and\, possibly\, transportation to and from the meetup
  site. Participants are responsible for their own safety and affirm that t
 hey have the appropriate skills\, physical conditioning\, equipment\, and 
 supplies. Hiking may involve risks to oneself and property. Neither your h
 ike organizer nor Asheville Hiking Group can assure your safety nor elimin
 ate all risks. Participants assume full responsibility for any injuries\, 
 damages\, or losses.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/314677150
 /
